  "body_html": "<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"inventory\">\n<p>Cuando <strong><em>te Equipas</em></strong>, marca varios ◇ abajo, en objetos concretos o en Sin Definir.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\">\n<li>Para una <strong>carga ligera</strong> (<em>rápido y silencioso</em>), marca hasta 3 ◇</li>\n<li>Para una <strong>carga normal</strong>, marca 4-6 ◇</li>\n<li>Para una <strong>carga pesada</strong> (<em>ruidoso, lento, caluroso, agotador</em>), marca 7-9 ◇</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"undefined\">Sin definir</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-undef\"><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-0\" title=\"Marca 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Marca 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-1\" title=\"Marca 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Marca 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-2\" title=\"Marca 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Marca 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-3\" title=\"Marca 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Marca 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-4\" title=\"Marca 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Marca 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-5\" title=\"Marca 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Marca 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-6\" title=\"Marca 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-6\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-6\" aria-label=\"Marca 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-7\" title=\"Marca 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-7\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-7\" aria-label=\"Marca 8\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-8\" title=\"Marca 9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-8\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-8\" aria-label=\"Marca 9\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Cuando <strong><em>Tienes lo Necesario</em></strong>, mueve una marca de aquí a un ◇ concreto de abajo.</p>\n<h3 id=\"gear\">Equipo</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Suministros</strong> (4+Prosperidad usos ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Más suministros</strong> (4+Prosperidad usos ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Aún más suministros</strong> (4+Prosperidad usos ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\"><em>Usa suministros para Recuperarte, Acampar o tener objetos <em>pequeños</em> extra.</em></p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-mess-kit-0\"><span><strong>Utensilios de cocina</strong> (requiere fuego y agua; hace que los Suministros duren más)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-bedroll-0\"><span><strong>Petate</strong> (recupera 1d6 HP extra cuando Acampas)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-blanket-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-blanket-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-blanket-0\"><span><strong>Manta</strong> (<em>abrigada</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\"><span><strong>Muda de ropa</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rope-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-rope-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-rope-0\"><span><strong>Cuerda</strong>, ~8 metros</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shovel-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shovel-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-shovel-0\"><span><strong>Pala</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-1\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-sledge-0\"><span><strong>Trineo/camilla/narria</strong>, enrollable</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\"><span><strong>Raquetas de nieve</strong></span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-torch-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-torch-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-torch-0\"><span><strong>Antorcha</strong> (dura ~1 hora; <em>alcance</em>, <em>área</em>, <em>peligrosa</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\"><span><strong>Lámpara de aceite</strong> (○○○ horas, <em>cerca</em>, <em>área</em>, <em>tosca</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-oil-0\"><span><strong>Aceite extra</strong> (○○○○○ horas, para lámpara/farol, inútil como arma)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-1\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-firewood-0\"><span><strong>Leña</strong> (suficiente para 1 noche entera, <em>alcance</em>, <em>área</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-hatchet-0\"><span><strong>Hacha pequeña</strong>, de hierro (<em>mano</em>, <em>arrojadiza</em>, x perforante)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mallet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mallet-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-mallet-0\"><span><strong>Mazo</strong>, de hierro y/o madera (<em>mano</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mattock-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mattock-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-mattock-0\"><span><strong>Zapapico</strong>, de hierro (<em>cerca</em>, x perforante, <em>cruento</em>, <em>aparatoso</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-1\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-maul-0\"><span><strong>Martillo pesado</strong>, de hierro (<em>cerca</em>, <em>contundente</em>, <em>aparatoso</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-staff-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-staff-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-staff-0\"><span><strong>Bastón</strong> (<em>cerca</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-spear-0\"><span><strong>Lanza</strong>, de hierro (<em>cerca</em>, <em>arrojadiza</em>, x perforante)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-long-spear-0\"><span><strong>Lanza larga</strong>, de hierro (<em>alcance</em>, x perforante)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bow-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bow-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-bow-0\"><span><strong>Arco y flechas de hierro</strong> (<em>próximo</em>, x perforante, ○ poca munición, ○ agotada)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\"><span><strong>Flechas extra</strong> (x perforante, ○ de sobra, ○ pocas, ○ agotadas)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-javelins-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-javelins-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-javelins-0\"><span><strong>Jabalinas</strong>, unas pocas, de hierro (<em>arrojadizas</em>, x perforante, +1 de daño, ○ agotadas)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-1\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-shield-0\"><span><strong>Escudo</strong> (+1 armadura, +1 Preparación con 7+ al Defender)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-thick-hides-0\"><span><strong>Pieles gruesas</strong> (1 armadura, <em>abrigadas</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-cloak-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-cloak-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><label for=\"inv-cloak-0\"><span><strong>Capa</strong> (<em>abrigada</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"possessions-items-loot\">Posesiones, objetos, botín</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot0-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot0-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot0\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objeto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot1-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot1-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot1\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objeto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot2-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot2-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot2\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objeto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot3-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot3-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot3\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objeto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot4-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot4-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot4\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objeto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot5-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot5-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot5\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objeto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot6-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot6-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot6\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objeto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot7-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot7-0\" aria-label=\"Hueco\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot7\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Objeto\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-things\">Otras cosas</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">(animales, aperos, objetos escondidos, etc.)</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:other-things\" rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"Otras cosas\"></textarea></div>\n<h3 id=\"small-items\">Objetos pequeños</h3>\n<p>Caben en un bolsillo, una bolsa o una bota. Cuando <strong><em>te Equipas</em></strong>, marca ☐ abajo igual a 4+Prosperidad.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-small-undef\"><span class=\"track-label\">Sin definir</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-0\" title=\"Marca 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Marca 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-1\" title=\"Marca 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Marca 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-2\" title=\"Marca 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Marca 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-3\" title=\"Marca 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Marca 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-4\" title=\"Marca 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Marca 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-5\" title=\"Marca 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Marca 6\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Cuando <strong><em>Tienes lo Necesario</em></strong>, mueve una marca de aquí a los objetos de abajo, o gasta suministros para marcar un ☐ adicional.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list inv-small\">\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-knife\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-knife\" data-check-id=\"inv-knife\"> <span><strong>Cuchillo o daga</strong>, de hierro (<em>mano</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-sling\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sling\" data-check-id=\"inv-sling\"> <span><strong>Honda</strong> (<em>próximo</em>, <em>recarga</em>, <em>aparatosa</em>, ○ poca munición, ○ agotada)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-rushlight\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rushlight\" data-check-id=\"inv-rushlight\"> <span><strong>Vela de junco</strong> (dura ~15-30 minutos, <em>mano</em>, <em>tosca</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-tinderbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-tind